COMPILATION OF: E46N6

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N6

   1 a 0000 E46N6:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] OUTPUT THEN SKIP, two statements.  Pairs
   4 a 0006      with E46N7: the two must differ ONLY in the order of
   5 a 0006      the two statement blocks. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   7 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N6OUT DAT');
   8 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A');
   9 c 003D   put file(outf) skip;
  10 c 0051   close file(outf);
  11 a 0057 end E46N6;

CODE SIZE = 005A
DATA AREA = 000A
FREE SYMS = 389D
END  COMPILATION
